error[NK1102]: `Vec::push` expects `value` to be `String` here, but you're passing `ref String`.
   --> tests/for_over_lines_of_a_throwing_call_refused.nika:16:61
    |
 16 |             if !uses.contains(line.to_string()) { uses.push(line.to_string()) }
    |                                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: This is a view: it points into text that something else owns.
    = note: `Vec::push` keeps its `value` after the call returns, so it needs text of its own.
    = note: Nikaia never copies text behind your back: a copy costs as much as the text is long, so it's written where it happens.
    = help: Write `.clone()` to copy it here.
